<main class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs"><a href="../">Home</a> / <span aria-current="page">Guide</span></nav>
<h1>JSON Guide</h1>
<div class="answer"><b>TL;DR:</b> JSON — double quotes, no trailing comma, no comments, escape line breaks as \n. Validate with formatting.</div>
<h2>Top 5 mistakes</h2>
<table class="data"><tr><th>Mistake</th><th>Wrong</th><th>Correct</th></tr>
<tr><td>Trailing comma</td><td><code>&#123;&quot;a&quot;:1,&#125;</code></td><td><code>&#123;&quot;a&quot;:1&#125;</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Single quotes</td><td><code>&#123;'a':1&#125;</code></td><td><code>&#123;&quot;a&quot;:1&#125;</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Comment</td><td><code>&#123;&quot;a&quot;:1 // comment&#125;</code></td><td><code>&#123;&quot;a&quot;:1&#125;</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Unescaped line break</td><td><code>&#123;&quot;t&quot;:&quot;a
b&quot;&#125;</code></td><td><code>&#123;&quot;t&quot;:&quot;a\nb&quot;&#125;</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>NaN/Infinity</td><td><code>&#123;&quot;v&quot;:NaN&#125;</code></td><td><code>&#123;&quot;v&quot;:null&#125;</code></td></tr>
</table>
<h2>Tips</h2>
<ul>
<li>Format with indent 2 for diffs, minify for production.</li>
<li>Sort keys for stable snapshots and tests.</li>
<li>Store large JSON in <code>.json</code> with UTF-8 without BOM.</li>
</ul>
<h2>FAQ</h2><div class="faq">{faqs.map(f => (<details><summary>{f.q}</summary><p>{f.a}</p></details>))}</div>
